          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "27、底物水平磷酸化\n28、脂肪酸的  $\\omega$  氧化\n29、逆转录\n30、糖异生"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.205,
            0.467,
            0.22
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "三、单项选择题:（15题，每题1分，共15分）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.094,
            0.232,
            0.561,
            0.246
          ],
          "content": "31、可合成肾上腺素、儿茶酚胺及黑色素的氨基酸是（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.253,
            0.182,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": "A. Trp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.221,
            0.254,
            0.284,
            0.268
          ],
          "content": "B. Asp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.324,
            0.254,
            0.382,
            0.267
          ],
          "content": "C. Ser"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.422,
            0.254,
            0.481,
            0.267
          ],
          "content": "D. Tyr"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.521,
            0.253,
            0.578,
            0.266
          ],
          "content": "E. Thr"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.094,
            0.273,
            0.49,
            0.287
          ],
          "content": "32、嘌呤核苷酸从头合成中，首先合成的是（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.294,
            0.175,
            0.308
          ],
          "content": "A.IMP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.295,
            0.264,
            0.307
          ],
          "content": "B.AMP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.279,
            0.295,
            0.337,
            0.307
          ],
          "content": "C.GMP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.377,
            0.295,
            0.436,
            0.307
          ],
          "content": "D.XMP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.468,
            0.295,
            0.518,
            0.306
          ],
          "content": "E.ATP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.094,
            0.315,
            0.577,
            0.328
          ],
          "content": "33、下列关于嘧啶核苷酸合成的叙述哪一项是正确的？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.334,
            0.427,
            0.349
          ],
          "content": "A. 游离的氨是氨甲酰磷酸合成酶的底物"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.459,
            0.334,
            0.762,
            0.348
          ],
          "content": "B. 利用线粒体中的氨基甲酰磷酸合成酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.356,
            0.355,
            0.37
          ],
          "content": "C.二氢乳清酸脱氢酶是限速酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.369,
            0.356,
            0.637,
            0.37
          ],
          "content": "D.嘧啶环中的一个碳原子来自  $CO_{2}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.376,
            0.396,
            0.391
          ],
          "content": "E.CMP 是其它嘧啶核苷酸的前体物"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.094,
            0.397,
            0.525,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": "34、下列关于复制和转录的描述哪项是正确的？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.416,
            0.876,
            0.431
          ],
          "content": "A. 在体内只有一条 DNA 链转录。而两条 DNA 链都复制 B. 在这两个过程中合成方向都是  $5' \\rightarrow 3'$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.437,
            0.668,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": "C.两过程均需要 RNA 为引物 D.复制产物在通常情况下大于转录产物"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.459,
            0.464,
            0.472
          ],
          "content": "35、核酸分子中核苷酸之间的连接键是:（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.479,
            0.189,
            0.493
          ],
          "content": "A.糖苷键"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.22,
            0.48,
            0.275,
            0.493
          ],
          "content": "B.肽键"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.325,
            0.48,
            0.38,
            0.492
          ],
          "content": "C. 氢键"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.43,
            0.479,
            0.539,
            0.492
          ],
          "content": "D. 磷酸二脂键"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.094,
            0.499,
            0.896,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": "36、按公式  $\\Delta G0^{\\prime}=-2.3RTlgK^{\\prime}eq$ ，确定下列反应的自由能: $A+B\\rightarrow C$ （A、B、C 都为 10mol/L）为（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.521,
            0.185,
            0.534
          ],
          "content": "A.-9.2RT"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.216,
            0.521,
            0.286,
            0.534
          ],
          "content": "B.-4.6RT"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.326,
            0.521,
            0.396,
            0.533
          ],
          "content": "C.-2.3RT"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.436,
            0.521,
            0.5,
            0.533
          ],
          "content": "D.2.3RT"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.523,
            0.521,
            0.59,
            0.533
          ],
          "content": "E. 4.6RT"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.094,
            0.541,
            0.593,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": "37、下列哪一些陈述是符合 Mitchell 的化学渗透学说的？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.094,
            0.561,
            0.734,
            0.637
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "① 合成 ATP 的能量是在质子顺着电化学梯度重新进入线粒体内膜的过程中产生的\n②二硝基酚能实现粒体内膜对质子的渗透性增加\n③ 当电子通过传递链时,正电荷主动移出线粒体内膜而使电荷得到分离\n④ 线粒体内膜内侧的 pH 通常比线粒体内膜外侧的低一些"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.645,
            0.194,
            0.658
          ],
          "content": "A.  $1+2+3$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.219,
            0.645,
            0.269,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": "B. $1 + 3$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.293,
            0.645,
            0.345,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": "C.  $2+4$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.369,
            0.645,
            0.403,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": "D. 4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.426,
            0.645,
            0.514,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": "E. 1+2+3+4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.665,
            0.541,
            0.678
          ],
          "content": "38、下列有关 Krebs 循环的叙述，哪项是错误的？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.685,
            0.307,
            0.699
          ],
          "content": "A. 产生 NADH 和  $FADH_{2}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.409,
            0.685,
            0.524,
            0.698
          ],
          "content": "B.有 GTP 生成"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.706,
            0.348,
            0.72
          ],
          "content": "C. 不能提供草酰乙酸的净合成"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.441,
            0.705,
            0.656,
            0.719
          ],
          "content": "D. 在无氧条件下它不能运转"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.727,
            0.35,
            0.741
          ],
          "content": "E. 把乙酰基氧化为  $CO_{2}$  和  $H_{2}O$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.747,
            0.561,
            0.761
          ],
          "content": "39、脂肪酸在细胞中氧化降解，下列哪项是正确的？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.768,
            0.527,
            0.864
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "A. 从酰基 CoA 开始\nB. 产生的能量不能为细胞所利用\nC. 被肉毒碱抑制\nD. 主要在细胞核中进行\nE. 在降解过程中反复脱下三碳单位使脂肪酸链变短"
        },
        {
