          "content": "E. 27"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.224,
            0.533,
            0.238
          ],
          "content": "42、痛风症治疗的有效药物是别嘌呤醇,因为它能（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.244,
            0.245,
            0.259
          ],
          "content": "A. 激活尿酸酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.285,
            0.244,
            0.439,
            0.258
          ],
          "content": "B. 激活尿酸氧化酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.47,
            0.244,
            0.64,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": "C. 抑制黄嘌呤氧化酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.664,
            0.244,
            0.834,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": "D. 激活黄嘌呤氧化酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.265,
            0.512,
            0.279
          ],
          "content": "43、嘌呤核苷酸和嘧啶核苷酸合成都需要的是（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.286,
            0.192,
            0.3
          ],
          "content": "A. 甘氨酸"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.286,
            0.314,
            0.299
          ],
          "content": "B. 氨甲酰磷酸"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.338,
            0.286,
            0.428,
            0.299
